msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_Case_wav/1_Line"
msgid "Ah, here you are… Hiding in your room. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_Case_wav/6_Line"
msgid ""
"Even if you kill me, you’ll be fighting the others for years… Please, just "
"let them go and NO one else needs to die for either of us… Please…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_Case_wav/7_Line"
msgid "Everything dies Poppy… everything except us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_Case_wav/4_Line"
msgid "Failed. It scared you. And so, you ran. Like a child."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_Case_wav/3_Line"
msgid ""
"I can’t… I can’t be who they need. I’m not… I didn’t ask for them to look to "
"me… But I—"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_Case_wav/11_Line"
msgid "I know only one way to make you see this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_Case_wav/12_Line"
msgid "No, no no no! Prototype, please—"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_Case_wav/5_Line"
msgid ""
"Prototype… Stop this. Please. You wanted something better, but if you don’t "
"let the orphans go, you won’t get it. Don’t you see that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_Case_wav/2_Line"
msgid "Running away… from the… rebellion you started."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_Case_wav/13_Line"
msgid "STOP! PLEASE!!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_Case_wav/8_Line"
msgid "What are you—"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_Case_wav/9_Line"
msgid "You refuse truth. You refuse reality:"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_Case_wav/10_Line"
msgid ""
"Your orphans can never go free. The work must continue. Otherwise, we’ll be "
"left with nothing, and infinity will be lonely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_ElliotPrototype_wav/3_Line"
msgid " Oliver?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_ElliotPrototype_wav/22_Line"
msgid ""
"...Nothing can make things go back to how they used to be, but we could be a "
"family, if you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_ElliotPrototype_wav/24_Line"
msgid "And as for your name, I can call you whatever you like."
