msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/5_Line"
msgid "And Satanic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/13_Line"
msgid ""
"Great. Yes...um...Disgusting-in-a-bad-way. I wrote it down twice. Okay, "
"anyone else-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/22_Line"
msgid "How about positive feedback? Is there anything we like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/21_Line"
msgid "I just really think it's in bad taste. It's all very Jeffrey Dahmer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/23_Line"
msgid "I like the one with the doobie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/20_Line"
msgid "I mean I wouldn't like it. But, you know, the kids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/3_Line"
msgid "I think they're disgusting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/17_Line"
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/12_Line"
msgid "In a bad way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/8_Line"
msgid ""
"Is that what you're trying to teach kids? How to turn animals inside out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/9_Line"
msgid "Is the octopus... is he turning into a fish skeleton? I don't get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/6_Line"
msgid "Mm-hmmm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/10_Line"
msgid "Octopuses don't have bones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/24_Line"
msgid "Oh that's uh, not... that's a paintbrush."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/25_Line"
msgid "Oh. Then I don't like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Okay so again, thank you all for coming in and being a part of this focus "
"group."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/19_Line"
msgid "Okay you'd like one of them-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/11_Line"
msgid "Okay, let's stay on track here. So I have... uh... disgusting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/4_Line"
msgid "Okay. Okay. Well, no wrong answers. Can you tell me a little-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/7_Line"
msgid "They do kinda look like... demonic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/18_Line"
msgid ""
"What if one of these outside-imals, you know, what if he had a skateboard?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/16_Line"
msgid "What if they had a skateboard?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/2_Line"
msgid ""
"What you just saw was a promo for our newest line of toys, the Wrongside "
"Outimals. We'd love to get your honest reaction to-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_FocusGroup_wav/15_Line"
msgid "Yeah, I wrote that one down...we're good on the Satanic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/10_Line"
msgid "... another breach on four... forty meters... closing.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/12_Line"
msgid "...They're in the damn room. How are there so many of them..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/3_Line"
msgid ""
"...all of them I think. I don't know how many. They took apart Robertson. "
"They literally took him apart, Todd."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/6_Line"
msgid "...open the door, Miss Gracie. We just want to play."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/9_Line"
msgid "Come be the joy the world needs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/5_Line"
msgid ""
"Don't tell me to sit, Todd. These little monsters are trying to kick down my "
"door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/14_Line"
msgid ""
"Get back. GET BACK. Baba, I was just... I was just trying to make you all "
"happy... I wasn't... please... DON'T HURT ME."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/4_Line"
msgid ""
"Just sit... security forces will get you...(distortion)...mass casualties in "
"the game station."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/1_Line"
msgid "Miss Graaaaaaacie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/2_Line"
msgid "Open the door, we won't hurt you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/11_Line"
msgid "Todd!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/13_Line"
msgid "Todd? TODD?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/15_Line"
msgid ""
"We're not gonna hurt you, Miss Gracie. We have something very special planned "
"for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/7_Line"
msgid "Yeah the friends are all here. Let's spread some joy all over that room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieFate_wav/8_Line"
msgid "You hear them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/10_Line"
msgid "(Concerned growl)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/6_Line"
msgid "(Growls)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/5_Line"
msgid "Chum’s not my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/3_Line"
msgid "Go away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/8_Line"
msgid "He’s here to help make your world just a little softer and quieter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/9_Line"
msgid "I don’t like it. I don’t like it in there. I can hear his heart beating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/13_Line"
msgid "I don’t want to. Don’t…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/15_Line"
msgid "It’s okay. I’m better. I’m better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/1_Line"
msgid "Meeeeegan. Heya Megan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/4_Line"
msgid "Now that’s not very nice! You’re going to hurt our friend’s feelings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/17_Line"
msgid ""
"Now you just close your eyes and breathe deep. Everything’s better when "
"you’re with a friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/16_Line"
msgid "Of course you are. That’s what Chum is for. A little safe space for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/11_Line"
msgid "Oh that’s just a recording of a heartbeat, silly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/14_Line"
msgid "Oh there you go. See. That’s not so bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/2_Line"
msgid ""
"One of the friends told me that you’re having trouble with the noise of the "
"world being just too much! I brought someone to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/12_Line"
msgid ""
"Something to make you feel warm and safe. Like a little baby! Why don’t you "
"just come here-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_GracieMegan_wav/7_Line"
msgid ""
"Well sure he is. Chum’s friends to all kids, especially sensitive ones like "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/16_Line"
msgid ""
"(On TV) Let’s sink down. Sink down and quiet. You are a toy. You have always "
"been a toy. Isn’t that the most beautiful thing in the world?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/5_Line"
msgid "Am Ms. Gracie, snap out of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/13_Line"
msgid "And I love crumpets. Crumpets are the best!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/4_Line"
msgid "Aren’t I real? Ms. Gracie says I’m real. I-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/17_Line"
msgid "I am a toy, Ms. Gracie. I’m a good toy. I promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/9_Line"
msgid ""
"I can’t believe I thought you were actually in the room, Ms Gracie! Egg on my "
"face!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/11_Line"
msgid "I want to go home-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/7_Line"
msgid "My hands… plastic… my face… Aren’t I… I thought…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/12_Line"
msgid "NO! We're going to have a tea party! I love tea parties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/15_Line"
msgid "No, no , no, we can brush our hair and hang with the friends!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/8_Line"
msgid "Oh how embarrassing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/10_Line"
msgid "Oh, oh, oh! I love Huggy and I love Kissy and I love all the friends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/14_Line"
msgid "Please let me out-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/6_Line"
msgid ""
"Silly. Silly silly silly. She’s on the screen, she’s not actually in the room "
"with us. Look around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/3_Line"
msgid "Ughh, Just ignore her, she’s not real. It’s only you here. Just. You."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_LilyConditioning_wav/2_Line"
msgid "… What are we talking about, Ms. Gracie? Is this another lesson?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/10_Line"
msgid "And if it doesn’t work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/13_Line"
msgid "And the Park?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/8_Line"
msgid "He can’t be the people’s champion if he’s one of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/2_Line"
msgid ""
"He’s become some sort of “people’s champion.” Now too many noses are sniffing "
"around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/6_Line"
msgid "I think Mr. Lovitz is due for a promotion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/16_Line"
msgid "I trust you won’t burn this place down in my absence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/15_Line"
msgid "I’ll be inspecting the premises next week, 7th to the 12th,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/17_Line"
msgid ""
"I’ll do my best. Though I won’t lie, this place is feeling more like a powder "
"keg every day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/1_Line"
msgid "Leith, I’ve been reviewing your concerns about our Head of Shipping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/4_Line"
msgid "Not if we deal with it the right way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/5_Line"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/12_Line"
msgid ""
"Our friends in Tokyo are coming up to speed. At this rate, this factory won’t "
"even be our main focus in a few short years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/14_Line"
msgid "Renovations are underway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/9_Line"
msgid ""
"Up his pay. His title. New parking spot. Give him a new car too. Let everyone "
"think he sold his soul."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/3_Line"
msgid "We deal with this now, we’ll make him a martyr."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/11_Line"
msgid "You worry too much. Try focusing on the bigger picture;"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PierreRitterman_wav/7_Line"
msgid "You’re serious?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PoppyKissy_wav/8_Line"
msgid "(Crying)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PoppyKissy_wav/5_Line"
msgid "(Determined chirping)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PoppyKissy_wav/10_Line"
msgid "Hey, I… I’m here for you… I feel it too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PoppyKissy_wav/3_Line"
msgid "I think they’re gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PoppyKissy_wav/6_Line"
msgid "It was an ambush. I… Somehow Prototype’s hunters knew we’d be here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PoppyKissy_wav/9_Line"
msgid "It wasn’t supposed to be like this… I’m supposed to be…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PoppyKissy_wav/2_Line"
msgid "Keep looking. The last of them can’t have gotten far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PoppyKissy_wav/4_Line"
msgid "Kissy, our friends… They’re gone too. I’m so sorry…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PoppyKissy_wav/11_Line"
msgid ""
"Let’s be scared together. You and me. I hold onto you, and you hold onto me. "
"Just like always."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PoppyKissy_wav/12_Line"
msgid ""
"Let’s… Let’s just wait it out a few more minutes. Until we know it’s safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PoppyKissy_wav/1_Line"
msgid "Shhhh…."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PoppyKissy_wav/7_Line"
msgid "We need to call Ollie and—"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/4_Line"
msgid "(Panicking) I-I don’t…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/18_Line"
msgid "(Screaming in pain) Roxie. And Tee-Tee, Tamago Turtle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/2_Line"
msgid "(Screams in pain)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/6_Line"
msgid "After the Hour. Just after."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/19_Line"
msgid "And you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/12_Line"
msgid "I look after you. All of you. You can tell me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/7_Line"
msgid "It was Gentle John and… Some of the others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/16_Line"
msgid "It was just rumors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/11_Line"
msgid "I…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/1_Line"
msgid "Please, I don’t know what you want. I don’t know anything about—"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/5_Line"
msgid "Remember: The cost for a lie is… dire…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/14_Line"
msgid "Th- They went to the outside. They… left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/13_Line"
msgid "Th-They’re gone… I-I’m… I’m sorry…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/9_Line"
msgid "They wanted to… go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/8_Line"
msgid "They… They were afraid. Of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/3_Line"
msgid "Twenty-three are missing. I am told… You possess knowledge… of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/20_Line"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/10_Line"
msgid "Where are they hiding? Playcare? Gamestation? Factory floor?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/15_Line"
msgid "Who else knows?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/17_Line"
msgid "Who knows? I require names."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeInterrogation_wav/21_Line"
msgid "You know. And no one can know. I am sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/16_Line"
msgid "(Softly crying)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/9_Line"
msgid "Because he’s soft."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/14_Line"
msgid "But I… I never wanted this…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/3_Line"
msgid "Don’t be a coward. You know what they did to us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/7_Line"
msgid "In there. He tied them up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/2_Line"
msgid "It wasn’t supposed to be like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/12_Line"
msgid "N-No… No, I-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/6_Line"
msgid "Survivors?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/13_Line"
msgid "They can’t leave. And they can’t stay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/1_Line"
msgid ""
"This is ridiculous. Tying them up, leaving them in there… Just kill them and "
"be done with it. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/10_Line"
msgid "This isn’t…I  can’t. I just can’t…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/15_Line"
msgid "Want is inconsequential. We agreed. We do this, together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/4_Line"
msgid ""
"What did these people do? They work in the warehouse. They’ve never even been "
"down to Playcare."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/8_Line"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/11_Line"
msgid "You can. You have to. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cassette_PrototypeKills_wav/5_Line"
msgid "You don’t know them any more than I do. Let’s just leave before-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Critter_Memory02_Line01/1_Line"
msgid "I don't want to be here. I don't want to be me. I don't want to be this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Critter_Memory02_Line02/2_Line"
msgid ""
"DON'T PUT ME IN THE BOX. DON'T PUT ME IN THE BOX. I'LL BE GOOD. I'LL PLAY. "
"DON'T PUT ME IN THE BOX."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Critter_Memory02_Line02/1_Line"
msgid "No. NO no. NO PLEASE. PLEASE JUST TELL ME WHO I AM."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cutouts_Chum_01/1_Line"
msgid "Muh muh, muh muh muh MUH!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cutouts_Chum_02/1_Line"
msgid "Muh muh muh, muh muh muh? muh muh muh muh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cutouts_Chum_03/1_Line"
msgid "Muh muh MUH!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cutouts_Giblet_01/1_Line"
msgid ""
"My name is [bzzzttttt] and I'm here to protect kids like you from all the "
"scary things that go bump in the night!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cutouts_Giblet_02/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Hold on to me and keep both eyes on danger, okay? We'll get through this... "
"together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cutouts_Lily_01/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Hi!!! I'm Lilly Lovebraids, the girl with flair and out-of-this-world hair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cutouts_Lily_01/2_Line"
msgid "Join me for a slumber party, and we can braid each other's hair!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cutouts_Lily_02/1_Line"
msgid ""
"What you do with your hair...Why, that's creativity and self expression at "
"work!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cutouts_Lily_03/1_Line"
msgid ""
"I always say, wear the hair that makes you feel like you, not like somebody "
"else!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cutouts_Lily_04/2_Line"
msgid "And you can eat it too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cutouts_Lily_04/1_Line"
msgid "Isn't hair so amazing. It grows right through your skin. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cutouts_Lily_05/1_Line"
msgid "Did you know your hair keeps growing even after you die?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Cutouts_Lily_06/1_Line"
msgid "Additional outfits and accessories sold seperately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Doctor_Line_00001/1_Line"
msgid "Well now, this is a rather interesting turn of events..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_EP_Giblet_Line_00001/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Don’t let this junk intimidate you, Butcher; it’s no match for you, hehe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_EP_Giblet_Line_00002/1_Line"
msgid "Steady as she goes, you’re doing great!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_EP_Giblet_Line_00003/1_Line"
msgid "Hey, Chum, tell them they’re doing great."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_EP_Giblet_Line_00004/1_Line"
msgid "Wow, this stuff looks complicated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_EP_Giblet_Line_00005/1_Line"
msgid "Don’t worry, Chum, the Butcher’s got this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00001/7_Line"
msgid "And the rest of them? Up at Safe Haven. I heard things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00001/5_Line"
msgid "Down here they're calling you The Playtime Butcher."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00001/1_Line"
msgid "Get off- HEY GET OFF."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00001/8_Line"
msgid "We can't stay here. I got a place. Just follow me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00001/6_Line"
msgid ""
"What are you doing all the way down here? Is Poppy...I mean, you were with "
"her, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00001/2_Line"
msgid "You alright?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00001/3_Line"
msgid "You're not..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00001/4_Line"
msgid ""
"You're the one they've been talking about! The one who put Mommy in the "
"grinder. Who gave the cat a nap."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00005/1_Line"
msgid ""
"My name's Giblet. I knew Poppy back before...well uh...before everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00005/3_Line"
msgid ""
"That girl's heart's always been in the right place but she's been behind "
"glass too long. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00005/2_Line"
msgid "Was she really gonna blow this place up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00010/1_Line"
msgid "This way. C'mon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00030/2_Line"
msgid "Find a place to hide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00030/1_Line"
msgid "No, no no no... He wouldn't come down here, just--"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00035/1_Line"
msgid "He doesn't usually come down here. You must'a got him real worked up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00035/2_Line"
msgid "This way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00045/2_Line"
msgid "And I got plans anyway, I... I'm not gonna be down here forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00045/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Yeah I know it's not much but uh... who needs fancy murals on the wall and "
"string lights or a barber shop or whatever?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00050/3_Line"
msgid "Both of us wanting to kill the Prototype."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00050/6_Line"
msgid ""
"But we gotta get you outfitted first. You're not gonna last down here with "
"just a cheap night light."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00050/4_Line"
msgid "I mean that's where this train is headed, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00050/5_Line"
msgid "I'm not some kind of hero but...I can help you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00050/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Look I'm not the kinda guy who spends time feeling sorry for himself. I mean "
"the way I see it, everything's a tragedy until it's meant to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00050/2_Line"
msgid "You think this is an accident? You ending up down here, like this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00051/1_Line"
msgid "Yeah chirp all you want, I'm the one who scared off all those Outimals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00055/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Here. The Boilers. Lots of gear got tossed down there after the uh... after "
"it all went down. Pretty sure I saw an old grabber. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00055/2_Line"
msgid "I'll point ya there. Just let me know when you've caught your breath."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00060/1_Line"
msgid "Hey. Don't mess with that. That's...um... personal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00065/1_Line"
msgid "(Sighs) Th-That's not--that's just... that's nothing. That's..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00065/2_Line"
msgid "Just a piece of trash I found."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00070/1_Line"
msgid "Just..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00070/2_Line"
msgid "Look,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00070/3_Line"
msgid ""
"no way you're getting around without a GrabPack. You uh... You should head to "
"the Boilers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00075/1_Line"
msgid "Alright, let's get you a new pair of mitts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00080/2_Line"
msgid ""
"Meet me up in R&D once you've got what you need. I'll get things cooking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00080/1_Line"
msgid "Through there. The Pipes will get you down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00082/1_Line"
msgid "Heeeey that grabber looks good on you.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00085/1_Line"
msgid "Uh, you get lost?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00090/1_Line"
msgid "Heh! The Playtime Butcher. Chum's gonna tear a seam when he meets you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00095/3_Line"
msgid "C'mon, I was just... filling in Chum on our plan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00095/2_Line"
msgid ""
"Chum, this is who everyone's been talking about! Poppy's Angel! Heh heh, The "
"Playtime Butcher. (Chuckles)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00095/1_Line"
msgid ""
"This is Chum Chompkins, my guy on the inside. We uh... sorta look out for "
"each other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00100/5_Line"
msgid "And all that science, it's here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00100/3_Line"
msgid ""
"But everyone has a weakness. And Playtime, they did all kinds of studies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00100/2_Line"
msgid ""
"I mean, you've seen the guy. He's so juiced up on that pink stuff you could "
"cut him in half and he'd just put himself back together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00100/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Look, we're not the first to try and take out the Prototype. Everyone who "
"tries, they fail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00100/4_Line"
msgid "Poking him with needles and uh...uh... Making spreadsheets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00105/1_Line"
msgid "C'mon! How many years we been talking about taking this guy out?!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00105/2_Line"
msgid "This is our chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00110/1_Line"
msgid "See, what'd I say? Everything happens for a reason."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00115/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Y-Yeah, just keep going. Y-You're almost there. Yeah...right there. Just hit "
"the scanner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00116/1_Line"
msgid "Should be a way to get that door open."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00120/2_Line"
msgid ""
"Her heart's in the right place but... Man, that girl's been behind glass too "
"long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00120/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's what I heard. Gas. Mining charges. She was gonna burn the whole "
"place down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00125/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Well... she doesn't know what happened to them. And I'm not gonna be the one "
"to tell her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00130/2_Line"
msgid "I always said it was safer down in Recycling. And I was right. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00130/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Well you know Doey. I mean, I'm sorry about what happened but... you know how "
"he was."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00140/1_Line"
msgid "Oh good. Got a little worried for a second-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00141/1_Line"
msgid "Hey, you found something! This is it! This is... Chum, what is this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00145/2_Line"
msgid "And looks like the Prototype doesn't want anyone to find it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00145/1_Line"
msgid "Negation formula? Sounds spicy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00145/3_Line"
msgid "They got it stored on a backup in IT."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00145/4_Line"
msgid "We can get there from the tram in Reanimation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00146/1_Line"
msgid "You can get us in there, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00150/1_Line"
msgid "\"No?\" W-What are you talking about, \"no\"? This is our chance!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00155/2_Line"
msgid "I.. I... look, I'm sorry. You help us out, and..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00155/3_Line"
msgid "We're even. I mean it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00155/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Well we gotta try! Or are you just happier being the Prototype's errand boy, "
"now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00160/1_Line"
msgid "Huh, the gel lab's a mess right now. Could go up from the pit. But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00160/2_Line"
msgid "Let's see...Hmm...Maybe we could risk Sweet Street to-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00161/1_Line"
msgid "Ah scrap."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00165/1_Line"
msgid "Hey, get back here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00170/1_Line"
msgid "CHUM. We need an exit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00175/1_Line"
msgid "Look I told you, I'm not a hero. I... Is she okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00180/1_Line"
msgid "You're... you're gonna be okay, Poppy. We'll find a way...  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00185/1_Line"
msgid "Don't worry about me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00185/3_Line"
msgid "That doesn't have to be who we are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00185/2_Line"
msgid "The things they did to us..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00190/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Look, the plan's... still the plan, right? We need to find that secret back-"
"up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00190/2_Line"
msgid "Next stop is the tram here in Reanimation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00206/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Hey, Butcher! If you can hear me, Poppy and I are at the front! Make your way "
"to us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00207/1_Line"
msgid "Butcher, up here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00208/1_Line"
msgid "Up here! This way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00209/1_Line"
msgid "C’mon! C’mon!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00210/1_Line"
msgid "Follow my voice!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00211/1_Line"
msgid ""
"(Frantic) There should be some disconnect levers around there. See if you can "
"hit them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00212/1_Line"
msgid "The cars are full of cargo; use whatever you can to slow him down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00220/1_Line"
msgid "I'm not holding my breath.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00225_ALT_01/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Butcher! I’ve got an idea! I’m gonna switch the tracks, pick up some speed! "
"Be ready to jump!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00226/1_Line"
msgid "Whew. Thought you were gone.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00227/1_Line"
msgid "Yeah yeah, I'm hurrying!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00228/1_Line"
msgid "Got it! Now hold on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00229/1_Line"
msgid ""
"(Frantic) You're almost at the end of the line, Butcher! Lose the spider and "
"JUMP!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00240/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Poppy. I... I... I couldn't..He took her. Kissy is... I don't know. I don't..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00245/1_Line"
msgid "Look I told you I wasn't a hero."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00250/1_Line"
msgid "This is it. This has gotta be where they keep the backup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblet_Line_00255/1_Line"
msgid "It's gotta be here. Keep looking.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Giblett_Line_00206/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Hey, Butcher! If you can hear me, Poppy and I are at the front! Make your way "
"to us! I’ll try to guide you through the intercom!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gomez_Line_00001/2_Line"
msgid "Happy, Happy, Disgust, Sad, Fear, Happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gomez_Line_00001/1_Line"
msgid "Same code. You just got fat fingers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/23_Line"
msgid "Best one yet!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/7_Line"
msgid "Growing up is scary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/1_Line"
msgid "Hey there, all you Lovely Lilies. It’s a sunny day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/10_Line"
msgid "I am a toy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/3_Line"
msgid "I feel safe. You feel safe, don’t you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/2_Line"
msgid "I feel warm. Don’t you feel warm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/20_Line"
msgid "I love that too! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/17_Line"
msgid "I loveee... getting to stay with all my Playtime friends FOREVER!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/16_Line"
msgid "I loveee... not having to worry about dying anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/5_Line"
msgid "It’s good to have fun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/6_Line"
msgid "It’s good to want to have fun... forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/15_Line"
msgid ""
"I’m going to say all of the things I love about being a toy, and you can come "
"up with some ideas with me! Hmmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/11_Line"
msgid "I’ve always been a toy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/14_Line"
msgid "Let’s play a game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/8_Line"
msgid "Let’s stay kids forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/18_Line"
msgid "Let’s use this time to name five things you love!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/9_Line"
msgid "Repeat after me: I’m staying here forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/22_Line"
msgid "That's a good one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/19_Line"
msgid "That’s great! Good job!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/12_Line"
msgid "Toys are here to be joy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/4_Line"
msgid "We have so much fun here, don’t we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/13_Line"
msgid "Yay! I have so much joy in me as a toy! Yay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Joy/21_Line"
msgid "You’re so creative!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/2_Line"
msgid "(Big yawn)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/1_Line"
msgid "(Fake Sleepy)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/23_Line"
msgid "(Snoring)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/20_Line"
msgid "Baby just close your eyes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/18_Line"
msgid "Being a toy is paradise. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/17_Line"
msgid "Being alive is the bad dream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/12_Line"
msgid "Boy, I bet having soft wool like Baba Chops feels nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/7_Line"
msgid "Close our eyes and count sheep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/6_Line"
msgid "Come on, Sleepy Sue, let’s take a nap together, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/5_Line"
msgid "Everyone does if they don’t get enough sleep!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/19_Line"
msgid "Go to sleep, Go to sleep..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/15_Line"
msgid "Go to sleep, little one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/8_Line"
msgid "Look! Baba’s gonna help us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/16_Line"
msgid "Maybe when we wake up we’ll all be toys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/3_Line"
msgid "Oh, hey there, Wonderful! I don’t know about you, but I am slee-ee-eepy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/9_Line"
msgid "One..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/11_Line"
msgid "Three..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/14_Line"
msgid "Toys never get cranky. They’re full of joy. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/10_Line"
msgid "Two..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/4_Line"
msgid "When I don’t get my beauty sleep, I turn into a big old grumpy bum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/21_Line"
msgid "When you wake, When you wake..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/13_Line"
msgid "Wouldn’t it be nice to be a toy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Slumber/22_Line"
msgid "You’ll be in paradise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Soft/10_Line"
msgid "And if any Negative Nancies tell us we can’t be toys?..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Soft/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Hey there, Wonderful. Do you want to feel comfortable? Do you want to feel "
"safe?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Soft/6_Line"
msgid "I wish I could be soft like Huggy and Kissy. Don’t you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Soft/8_Line"
msgid "Isn’t that the most beautiful thing in the world?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Soft/3_Line"
msgid "It’s too squishy, right? All that meat and bone? Yuck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Soft/13_Line"
msgid "Let's be soft... Let's be toys..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Soft/12_Line"
msgid "Let’s be soft like Huggy Wuggy, my little Sleepy Sam. Let’s be toys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Soft/2_Line"
msgid "Let’s give ourselves a biiiiig hug? How does that feel?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Soft/5_Line"
msgid "Let’s hug our Huggy and Kissy toys. Don’t they feel so soft?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Soft/7_Line"
msgid ""
"Let’s sink down. Sink down and quiet. You are a toy. You have always been a "
"toy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Soft/11_Line"
msgid "Then we'll pop their heads off! (Laughing)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Soft/9_Line"
msgid "Toys don't feel pain. Toys don't need answers. Toys are here to be joy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_ASMR_Soft/4_Line"
msgid "Wouldn't it feel nicer to be made of felt and fluff?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line01/5_Line"
msgid ""
"And for those naughty blocks that don't match, see if you can find a place "
"for those!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line01/1_Line"
msgid "Hey there, sleepy head! Rise and shine! It's time to meet the day!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line01/4_Line"
msgid "The friends all LOVE this game! Drop the block into the correct hole. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line01/3_Line"
msgid "Today we are going to play a game called cleaning up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line01/2_Line"
msgid ""
"We’re all proud of your progress, Huggy! You're going to make the friends SO "
"happy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line02/1_Line"
msgid "Don't be a Silly Sam, does that look like a square to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line03/1_Line"
msgid "A triangle has three points, Huggy! Every toy knows that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line04/1_Line"
msgid "A good toy knows this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line05/2_Line"
msgid "Like how we give joy! And it always comes back to us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line05/1_Line"
msgid "That's a circle! An endless loop…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_Dia_Gracie_Memory01_Line06/2_Line"
msgid ""
"I think someone’s ready for round two! It’ll be a little harder, but I "
"believe in you, Huggy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_Dia_Gracie_Memory01_Line06/1_Line"
msgid "Very good, Huggy! You're doing so great!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line07/1_Line"
msgid "Huggy, only a square can go there! You know that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line08/1_Line"
msgid "Hm, I don't think that's right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line09/1_Line"
msgid "You seem to be missing the point. Even on a shape with no points."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line10/1_Line"
msgid "Well that's the most important one of all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line11/1_Line"
msgid "Sorry, Huggy... Keep trying!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line12/1_Line"
msgid "Some toys you just can’t bend into shape, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line13/1_Line"
msgid "Awwwh. The friends are gonna be SO sad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line14/2_Line"
msgid ""
"Just a little more, and you’ll be exactly the kind of toy the friends need! "
"Be the joy, Huggy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line14/1_Line"
msgid "My my, aren’t YOU impressive!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line15/2_Line"
msgid "The bad toy box."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line15/1_Line"
msgid "You know what else is a square, Huggy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line16/1_Line"
msgid "A triangle, Huggy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line16/2_Line"
msgid "Past, present, and future! Mind, body, and soul! You know this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line17/1_Line"
msgid "Wrong, Huggy. Very wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line18/1_Line"
msgid "You’re making the friends sad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line19/1_Line"
msgid "This shouldn’t be hard for you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line20/1_Line"
msgid "Remember: Good toys do what they're told!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line21/1_Line"
msgid "It's important to stay on task, big guy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line22/1_Line"
msgid "You don't have to be angry, Huggy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line23/2_Line"
msgid "And out (exhales)..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory01_Line23/1_Line"
msgid "Now now. Let's all practice our breathing! In (inhales)..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line01/4_Line"
msgid "Always. Stay. In the light."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line01/2_Line"
msgid "Doesn't that make you wanna just... dance?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line01/1_Line"
msgid "Well look, all the friends are here! Isn't that amazing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line01/3_Line"
msgid ""
"Yeeah! Okay, so when you hear the music, you move your little feet! And when "
"the music stops, you make sure you're in the light, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line02/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Aw, look at you all go! Looking good out there! You all look soooooo happy! "
"It really brings a smile to my face!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line03/1_Line"
msgid "Huggy, don't be a Grumpy Gregory! I wanna see you SHAKE it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line04/4_Line"
msgid "Go and put them in the box."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line04/3_Line"
msgid "Huggy, you know where the bad toys go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line04/2_Line"
msgid "I guess they’re bad toys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line04/1_Line"
msgid "Seems like our toys here aren’t ready to be the joy anyone needs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line05/1_Line"
msgid "Now that's not how we spread joy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line06/1_Line"
msgid "Tsk tsk tsk. I think we can do better than that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line07/1_Line"
msgid "You're not being a good toy, Huggy. The friends won't like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line08/1_Line"
msgid "Huggy, please place the toy in the bad toy box."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line09/1_Line"
msgid "Yowch! That was painful!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line10/1_Line"
msgid "Awwww. It hurts me to see YOU hurt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line11/1_Line"
msgid "You've been a bad toy, Huggy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line12/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Hey little guy! You can't just sleep on the floor all day like a lazy bones..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line13/4_Line"
msgid "Come and play! Playing with friends is so much better!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line13/5_Line"
msgid "Keep going! Nice work everyone! Isn't this SO fun? Isn't this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line13/1_Line"
msgid "Oh! Sounds like someone's being a Grumpy Gregory, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line13/3_Line"
msgid "Oh, you all are... doing so so good. Wait till the friends uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line13/2_Line"
msgid "What do you want me to do? He's not getting up-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line14/2_Line"
msgid "Huggy, why don't you give them a time out. Put them in the bad toy box."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line14/1_Line"
msgid "I guess somebody's out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line15/1_Line"
msgid "Next round!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line15/3_Line"
msgid "Oh, looks like we have another toy to put in the box. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line15/2_Line"
msgid "Oh, the friends are gonna be so SO happy with you all! Keep moving!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line16/3_Line"
msgid "Because of you. Because of your joy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line16/1_Line"
msgid "Here we go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line16/2_Line"
msgid ""
"Look at you. Look at ALL of you. Spreading love. Spreading joy. Think about "
"how the world is such a better place..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line17/3_Line"
msgid "And the day after, too! The joy will NEVER stop! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line17/1_Line"
msgid "Awwh, more friends! More fun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line17/2_Line"
msgid "Don't stop, Huggy. We're gonna keep playing today, and tomorrow..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line18/2_Line"
msgid "But don't worry. We have a special toy box JUST for you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Gracie_Memory02_Line18/1_Line"
msgid "Oh, I'm sorry, Huggy. You're not gonna fit in there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_IGS_Giblet_Line_00003/1_Line"
msgid "Probably best if you head out, Butcher"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_IGS_Giblet_Line_00005/1_Line"
msgid "Still here I see…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_IGS_Giblet_Line_00006/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Ah, would you look at that! Guess it’s about time for me to start singing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_IGS_Giblet_Line_00006/2_Line"
msgid "You definitely wanna stick around for my singing, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_IGS_Giblet_Line_00007/1_Line"
msgid "Okay, here it goes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_IGS_Giblet_Line_00007/2_Line"
msgid ""
"Starts singing Doey’s theme (very badly) He's stretchy, he's gummy, he's "
"squishy, he's funny, he's something...."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_IGS_Giblet_Line_00008/1_Line"
msgid "Starts singing the Smiling Critters theme (very badly)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_IGS_Giblet_Line_00009/1_Line"
msgid "Starts singing Huggy’s theme (very badly)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_IGS_Giblet_Line_00010/1_Line"
msgid "(Ahem) Please leave…"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_DEATH_Line_01/2_Line"
msgid "And THIS is how you repay me?!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_DEATH_Line_01/1_Line"
msgid "I let you into my house... I let you come to my TEA PARTY..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00001/2_Line"
msgid "I don't think they're here for the party, Lily."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00001/1_Line"
msgid "Oh. My. Goodness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00001/4_Line"
msgid "We're going to have SO. MUCH. FUN."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00001/3_Line"
msgid "Well of course they are, Candy. Why else would they be here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00005/4_Line"
msgid "Maybe we could ask if they want to take a bubble bath?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00005/5_Line"
msgid "Now? No no no, we have to set up for the party!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00005/1_Line"
msgid "They smell like dead bodies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00005/2_Line"
msgid "Well that's not a nice thing to say, Candy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00005/3_Line"
msgid "What's a nicer way to tell a friend that they smell like gore?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00006/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Can you be a good toy and bring me the crumpets from the oven in the basement?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00007/1_Line"
msgid "I said they're in the oven in the basement!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00008/1_Line"
msgid "Why is it taking so long to get the crumpets?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00009/1_Line"
msgid "You weren't talking to anyone were you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00010/1_Line"
msgid "Oh that's amazing! Next, we'll have to find the friends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00010/2_Line"
msgid ""
"They should be around here somewhere, and I know they'd hate to miss this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00015/2_Line"
msgid ""
"Let's set the mood with a little music in case our special guest arrives "
"early."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00015/1_Line"
msgid "Oh he's gonna love these."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00020/1_Line"
msgid "Have you found the friends yet? Maybe they're upstairs?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00021/1_Line"
msgid "How dare you ignore me. Come back here right now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00022/1_Line"
msgid "I warned you about being rude while I'm speaking!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00023/1_Line"
msgid "You have until the count of 3 to get over here or it's timeout for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00024/1_Line"
msgid "You have until the count of 5 to get over here or it's timeout for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00025/5_Line"
msgid "1..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00025/4_Line"
msgid "2..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00025/3_Line"
msgid "3..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00025/2_Line"
msgid "4..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00025/1_Line"
msgid "5..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00026/1_Line"
msgid "It's the bad toy box for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00027/1_Line"
msgid "Now where was I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00028/1_Line"
msgid ""
"I'm off to prepare my famous sandwiches. You make sure the friends make it to "
"the party on time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00029/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Do you think the poster is enough to hide it? Shhh. We have guests here, "
"Candy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00030/2_Line"
msgid ""
"Well when our guest arrives, maybe he'll be so happy, he'll invite all of us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00030/1_Line"
msgid "Why can't we go to a Better Place, Lily?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00031/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Shut it! You've always been a bad toy! When he gets here, he'll see it too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00032/1_Line"
msgid "And then they killed Doey... (Laughs)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00033/2_Line"
msgid "No...we can't! We always kill our friends and then we're alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00033/1_Line"
msgid "We should kill them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00034/1_Line"
msgid "(Crying and screaming)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00035/1_Line"
msgid "Dolly Grub! Were you taking a bubble bath? Mmmmmm, vanilla. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00036/1_Line"
msgid "Now, who are we still missing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00037/2_Line"
msgid "And I'm so sorry for your loss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00037/1_Line"
msgid "Oh Baby! So nice of you to join us for tea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00040/1_Line"
msgid "Oh look who it is! Dusky, were you messing around in the garage?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00040/2_Line"
msgid "Remember, good toys wash their hands!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00045/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Oh this is the best day of my life. All of the friends. Ah, I almost forgot, "
"I need to get ready!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00046/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Follow me to the kitchen, we need to make final preparations before our "
"special guest arrives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00047/1_Line"
msgid ""
"There's no time to dilly dally, come over to the kitchen. He might arrive any "
"second now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00048/1_Line"
msgid "Oh look at this mess. We need to tidy up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00048/2_Line"
msgid "Return my recipe book to the nook upstairs while I get everything ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00049/1_Line"
msgid "Did you put the book away yet? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00050/1_Line"
msgid "Go mingle with the friends until our special guest arrives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00051/1_Line"
msgid "Are you being a prying Patty? That's not very respectful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00055/2_Line"
msgid "Maybe it was Dolly Grub."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00055/1_Line"
msgid "Who left this door open, Candy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00056/1_Line"
msgid "What is all the fuss down here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00057/1_Line"
msgid "I could have sworn I heard you chitter chattering."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00057/2_Line"
msgid "I think they're plotting an escape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00057/3_Line"
msgid "Oh of course they aren't. They can't leave before the party. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00065/1_Line"
msgid "What!? Is one of the friends in my room?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00070/1_Line"
msgid "It's okay. You're okay. Go back to sleep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00070/2_Line"
msgid "Nobody's gonna hurt you anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00070/3_Line"
msgid "Someone's been in here, Candy. SOMEONE WHO'S GOING IN THE BOX."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00075/1_Line"
msgid "NO NO NO! You can't leave! The party hasn't even started!!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00080/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Are our dear guests bored? Bored of little Tilly-Lily?... Why don't we play a "
"game? "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00080/4_Line"
msgid "But when I'm quiet, you have to stop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00080/2_Line"
msgid "Upstairs there's a sweet little Nursery."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00080/3_Line"
msgid "When I sing a pretty song, you can walk there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00085/1_Line"
msgid "Now run!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00090/1_Line"
msgid "Get to the Nursery before I catch yooooou."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00095/1_Line"
msgid "Follow the path to the prize!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00100/1_Line"
msgid "Remember to follow the path!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00105/1_Line"
msgid "Remember, no cheating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00110/1_Line"
msgid ""
"Follow the path and you might win. And if you win... you just might get a "
"priiiiiize."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00115/1_Line"
msgid "You're doing greeeeeeat!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00120/1_Line"
msgid "I'm geting closer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00125/2_Line"
msgid "A little Winning Wendy (Giggles)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00125/3_Line"
msgid "I wonder for how long..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00125/1_Line"
msgid "Well, look at YOU!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00130/1_Line"
msgid "Again! Again! (Crazed Giggle)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00135/1_Line"
msgid "Oh this is so much fun"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00140/1_Line"
msgid "Do you like my doodles?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00145/1_Line"
msgid "Did I see you move?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00150/1_Line"
msgid "That was a close one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00155/1_Line"
msgid "Almost got you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00160/1_Line"
msgid "Auh auh auh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00165/1_Line"
msgid "Don't move!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00170/1_Line"
msgid "Watch out! That's hot lava."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00175/1_Line"
msgid "Jump over that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00180/1_Line"
msgid "It's almost time for the party!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00185/1_Line"
msgid "You are SOO good at games!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00190/1_Line"
msgid "I love playing games before the party. It's so... relaxing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00195/1_Line"
msgid "You're getting closer to the prize."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00200/1_Line"
msgid "I can SEEE you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00205/1_Line"
msgid "You're running out of time (Giggles)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00210/1_Line"
msgid "Start!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00215/1_Line"
msgid "Go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00220/1_Line"
msgid "Greenlight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00225/1_Line"
msgid "Stop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00230/1_Line"
msgid "Redlight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00235/1_Line"
msgid "I told you not to cheat!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00240/1_Line"
msgid "Auh auh. That's against the rules."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00245/1_Line"
msgid "You wouldn't want to be a Cheating Charlie!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00250/1_Line"
msgid "Hey. You have to move. Its against the rules not too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00255/1_Line"
msgid "Get moving..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00255/2_Line"
msgid "NOW!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00260/1_Line"
msgid "Go, go, GO! You're making me angry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00265/3_Line"
msgid "KEEP IT UP AND YOU'LL WIN THE GRAND PRIZE!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00265/2_Line"
msgid "LET'S PICK UP THE PACE A BIT, SHALL WE?!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00265/1_Line"
msgid "THIS IS SO MUCH FUN, ISN'T IT?!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00285/1_Line"
msgid "And just where do you all think you're going?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00285/2_Line"
msgid "You wouldn't want to miss the Tea Party!! "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00290/2_Line"
msgid "He's going to kill them all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00290/3_Line"
msgid "No, Candy. Not Poppy. She's always been his favorite."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00290/1_Line"
msgid "Oh, our special guest is going to be thrilled."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00295/1_Line"
msgid "I think she's a little asking Annie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00295/2_Line"
msgid "She IS a little asking Annie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00300/2_Line"
msgid "Oooh please blow up the whole factory and BURN. EVERYONE. ALIVE."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00300/1_Line"
msgid "Ooooh, please take me out of my case. Oooooh, please rescue the orphans."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00300/3_Line"
msgid "Our special guest is here! (Giggles)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00305/1_Line"
msgid "SURPRISE!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00310/1_Line"
msgid "Uh oh. She doesn't know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00315/1_Line"
msgid "THIS IS ALL YOUR FAULT!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00315/2_Line"
msgid "YOU'RE GOING IN THE BAD TOY BOX!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "DT_DIA_Lily_Line_00320/1_Line"
msgid "If I can't go to a better place, you can't either!"
msgstr ""

